WEBVTT

00:01:58.697 --> 00:02:01.232
Anaamini sana kwa elimu.

00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:03.672
Alijua kwamba akipata fursa

00:02:03.672 --> 00:02:05.189
ya elimu ya juu,

00:02:05.189 --> 00:02:07.980
fursa ya kutangulia wengine,

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.232
ana nafasi nzuri ya kuishi

00:02:10.232 --> 00:02:14.121
katika dunia iliogeuka kichwa chini.

00:02:14.121 --> 00:02:17.146
Mfumo wa elimu ya juu

00:02:17.146 --> 00:02:20.282
ulifeli Patrick, Debbie na Wael,

00:02:20.282 --> 00:02:22.562
jinsi tu inavyofeli

00:02:22.562 --> 00:02:25.210
mamilioni ya wanafunzi

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:28.324
mamilioni waliohitimu shule za sekondari

00:02:28.324 --> 00:02:31.690
mamilioni ambao wamefuzu elimu ya juu